                     <title>Baldricus Dolensis</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">English hands occur in verses on fol. 2
                        ('Versus de crucifixo . . .'; s. xii1), in a couplet on fol. 83v ('Ambulat
                        in tenebris errando clericus omnis / Qui sine metrorum lege legend legit';
                        s. xiv/xv), in the title on fol. 1 ('Liber versificatus de diuersis tra[. .
                        .]; s. xv), and in scribbles on fol. 4.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">First recorded in the Supplement.</note>
                  </msItem>
